<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Coffee County, Tenn., $3.2 mln sale.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Coffee County, Tenn., $3.2 mln sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance a $3.2 million Coffee County, Tenn., school bond issue slated for competitive sale.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
